The csrc and include files are unchanged upstream sources from
python/sglang/kernels/jit/. Only the required compression, planner, fused normalization/rotation and
packed KV store computation plus their include closure are included.
The gather.py Triton kernel is unchanged from
python/sglang/kernels/ops/attention/dsv4/dequant_k_cache.py; its Python launch
adapter is local. Only the original V4 layout is instantiated.
The Python adapter uses the existing apache-tvm-ffi dependency to prepare the
typed entry points. It does not import SGLang runtime classes or configuration.
Programmatic dependent launches are disabled so preceding GEMM and carry writes
retain ordinary stream ordering.
